notes.diagram:
flowchart LR
  A([App]) --> B[API Gateway + Lambda]
  C[(AppConfig: model ID)] -.-> B
  B --> D[Converse API]
  D --> E{{Claude}}
  D --> F{{Nova}}
  D --> G{{Llama}}

flowchart LR
  A([Request]) --> R{Router}
  R -->|simple| S{{Small model}}
  R -->|complex| L{{Large model}}
  L -->|429| B[Backoff + jitter retry]
  B --> X[Cross-Region profile]
  X -->|still failing| F[Fallback model or cached reply]

flowchart LR
  Q([Query]) --> C{Complexity?}
  C -->|simple| S{{Small fast model}}
  C -->|hard| L{{Large model}}
  S --> O[Capped output tokens]
  L --> O
  O --> ST[Stream to user]
